# gate/CHANGELOG

## 20261106

0.2.3: /gate\.rb/gate/, the repository renamed; put the CHANGELOG in the standard form; + VERSION and gemspec tests.

1. ~ gate.rb.gemspec: spec.homepage: /http/https/, and /gate\.rb/gate/, the repository renamed.
2. ~ README.md: the fork URL: /gate\.rb/gate/, likewise.
3. + gate.rb.gemspec: spec.metadata: bug_tracker_uri, changelog_uri, documentation_uri and source_code_uri, each in the renamed repository.
4. The gem keeps its name, gate.rb, gate being taken on RubyGems.
5. ~ CHANGELOG: /gate\.rb/gate/ in the title, after the repository; a ## YYYYMMDD heading for each date, a summary line and numbered items, in place of Keep a Changelog's version headings and stars.
6. + CHANGELOG: 0.0.0 to 0.0.11, the revisions of lib/GateIo.rb from before the repository, each with the version and dates its header gives.
7. ~ LICENSE: /2025-2026/2024-2026/, the copyright running from 0.0.0, in 2024.
8. + test/VERSION_test.rb: Gate::VERSION is three numbers and matches the newest entry here.
9. + test/gemspec_test.rb: gate.rb.gemspec is valid, is named gate.rb, pins no date, takes its version from Gate::VERSION, declares http.rb, ships itself, and links only to the repository.
10. ~ Gate::VERSION: /0.2.2/0.2.3/

0.2.2: Load the suite past webmock's http_rb adapter; fix Gate::Configuration#configure, and default debug to false.

1. ~ test/helper.rb: + skip_webmocks_http_rb_adapter, as in eodhd 0.19.11. webmock's http_rb adapter took http.rb's lib/http.rb for the http gem's, and the suite stopped before loading.
2. ~ Gate::Configuration: - the comma after attr_accessor's :debug, which made the def configure after it one more accessor name, so that #configure read an attribute rather than yielding.
3. ~ Gate::Configuration#initialize: debug defaults to false, as reset! has it.
4. ~ test/Gate/Configuration_test.rb: must_equal and must_be_nil in place of RSpec's to eq; - api_base_url, which nothing has, the host being Gate::V4::Client::API_HOST; + #configure yields the configuration.
5. ~ Gate::VERSION: /0.2.1/0.2.2/


