## 20241025, 27

0.0.0: + GateIo::V4::Client#spot_currencies

1. + lib/GateIo.rb: class GateIo, GateIo::V4::Client.
2. + GateIo::V4::Client#spot_currencies: GET /spot/currencies.
3. + GateIo::V4::Client#do_request: a GET to https://api.gateio.ws/api/v4, signed with an HMAC-SHA512 of the verb, path, query string, payload hash and timestamp, sent in the KEY, SIGN and Timestamp headers; the response parsed as JSON.
